OL,3,ANeither war nor peace in Tigray - is
OL,4,AEthiopia's latest conflict really over?
OL,5,
OL,6,FRunning a hair salon in Mekelle,
OL,7,Fcapital of Ethiopia's troubled northern
OL,8,FTigray region, is not easy at the
OL,9,Fmoment.
OL,11,F"People can't prioritise beauty over
OL,12,Fdaily basic needs. For many residents,
OL,13,Fthinking about self-care is a luxury,
OL,14,Fat a time when they can't feed their
OL,15,Fkids," Firut Me'ar, who runs a salon in
OL,16,Fthe city, tells the BBC.
OL,18,FAfter a brief war, the city is under
OL,19,Fthe control of the national army but
OL,20,Flife is far from normal, says Firut, a
OL,21,Fsingle mother of a 10-year-old
OL,22,Fdaughter.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
